      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's better to ask a doc but i can't really get an appointment for like two weeks and the cramps are keeping me up at night. i dont want to wait that long if its just a simple mineral thing. like 99mg isn't even that much right? if i just take one every 4 hours instead of every few hours, is that safer? it feels like a small enough dose that it shouldn't really hurt my kidneys too much.",
