      "content": "I strongly advise caution, even with a lower dose. While 99mg may seem like a small amount, it's still a significant increase for someone with pre-existing stage 3 kidney disease. Taking 99mg every 4 hours can accumulate to 396mg daily, which may still put excessive strain on your kidneys, particularly if you're not able to monitor your potassium levels closely.",
